"While signed out, alarms are local-only and “This Device”\n      is the only target. Signing in never moves one automatically. Use the\n      app's explicit promotion action if you want an eligible local alarm to\n      become shared. For a shared alarm, use each device's “Rings On” switch to\n      request where it should ring and review whether the app shows “Scheduled,”\n      “Pending Apply,” “Pending Cancellation,” “Needs Permission,” “Unavailable,”\n      “Failed,” “Sync Pending,” or another status.\n      Rename or retire installations from the device controls when available.\n      Deleting a local-only alarm removes it only from that installation." = "While signed out, alarms are local-only and “This Device”\n      is the only target. Signing in never moves one automatically. Use the\n      app's explicit promotion action if you want an eligible local alarm to\n      become shared. For a shared alarm, use each device's “Rings On” switch to\n      request where it should ring and review whether the app shows “Scheduled,”\n      “Pending Apply,” “Pending Cancellation,” “Needs Permission,” “Unavailable,”\n      “Failed,” “Sync Pending,” or another status.\n      Rename or retire installations from the device controls when available.\n      Deleting a local-only alarm removes it only from that installation.";
